# brand-check.sh scans page-type files only (locale catalogues, index.html,
# llms.txt, robots.txt, security.txt, web manifests and profile/README.md),
# and this file can only narrow that set. In this repo the set is the profile.
# The "Other public text" step in .github/workflows/text-check.yml applies the
# same rules to every other Markdown file and to .github/.
profile/
